    {
      "text": "for we be brethren, Gen. 13:8. be lord over thy brethren, Gen. 27:29. his brethren envied him, Gen. 37:11. Joseph knew his brethren, but they knew not him, Gen. 42:8. Moses … went out unto his brethren, Ex. 2:11 (Acts 7:23). but over your brethren … ye shall not rule, Lev. 25:46. heart be not lifted up above his brethren, Deut. 17:20. Prophet … of thy brethren, Deut. 18:15 (Acts 3:22). Ye are my brethren … my bones and my flesh, 2 Sam. 19:12. nor fight against your brethren, 1 Kgs. 12:24 (2 Chr. 11:4). will ye even sell your brethren, Neh. 5:8. declare thy name unto my brethren, Ps. 22:22 (Heb. 2:12). good … for brethren to dwell together in unity, Ps. 133:1. even thy brethren … have dealt treacherously, Jer. 12:6.",
